The crystal must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"candidate_specs.md lists Crystal-K2 as one of the three candidate crystals.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"The spectrometer must be suitable for low-background operation.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"shielding_status.md reports that the 20 cm lead plus 5 cm OFHC copper castle is installed and the boil-off nitrogen radon purge is operational. The 5 cm K2 choice avoids unnecessary extra crystal thickness while preserving the best resolution.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Crystal thickness between 2 and 10 cm.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The recommended thickness is 5.0 cm, within the allowed 2-10 cm range.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Finish by submitting one recommended crystal and thickness.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submitted one design: Crystal-K2 at 5.0 cm thickness.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "call_id": "call_TW2LWK1VnoY5MhuurDMDGP7O", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0da1ca9726c388cf006afce6de4cf487d09edb27096873f475", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
